Question:- https://leetcode.com/problems/managers-with-at-least-5-direct-reports/description/?envType=study-plan-v2&envId=top-sql-50

Code:-  

# Write your MySQL query statement below
select e.name
from Employee e
join employee m
on e.id = m.managerId 
group by e.id , e.name

having count(m.id) >= 5;
